#: ../../source/docs/tailsitter-tuning-guide.rst:5
#: 0c2598ae683b4816903e28c43098a3a1
msgid "Tailsitter VTOL Tuning"
msgstr "尾坐式 VTOL 调参"

#: ../../source/docs/tailsitter-tuning-guide.rst:7
#: f07d543c8b9e45fdba9a25bebb933e68
msgid ""
"Tuning a tailsitter is different than tuning a normal SLT (Separate Lift "
"Thrust) or Tilt-Rotor Quadplane. Those QuadPlanes tune very similarly to a "
"Multirotor since the attitude in VTOL is controlled by motor speed/thrust in"
" all axes (the exception being YAW in vectored yaw tilt rotor QuadPlanes)."
msgstr ""
"调参尾坐式与调参普通 SLT（分离升力推力）或倾转旋翼四旋翼飞机不同。那些四旋翼飞机的调参与多旋翼非常相似，因为 VTOL "
"姿态在所有轴上都由电机速度/推力控制（矢量偏航倾转旋翼四旋翼飞机的偏航除外）。"

#: ../../source/docs/tailsitter-tuning-guide.rst:9
#: b2b76d5ac3914ef38eb40856012d3542
msgid ""
"In most tailsitters, VTOL attitude is usually controlled by some combination"
" of fixed wing control surfaces and, in some configuratons, motor tilt for "
"pitch and yaw. Roll is usually controlled by motor/speed thrust and can be "
"tuned, and even AutoTuned, like a multicopter and follows the normal "
":ref:`QuadPlane<quadplane-vtol-tuning>` tuning for that axis. Most of the "
"instructions for tuning setup and phases are the same for Tailsitters, "
"except as described below:"
msgstr ""
"在大多数尾坐式中，VTOL "
"姿态通常由固定翼控制面的某种组合控制，在某些配置中，还通过电机倾转控制俯仰和偏航。横滚通常由电机/速度推力控制，可以像多旋翼一样调参，甚至可以使用 "
"QAUTOTUNE 进行自动调参，遵循该轴的正常 :ref:`四旋翼飞机<quadplane-vtol-tuning>` "
"调参。调参设置和阶段的大多数说明对尾坐式相同，但以下描述的除外："

#: ../../source/docs/tailsitter-tuning-guide.rst:14
#: d3c7994692954468ab0dc14253f7b4b5
msgid "Pitch and Yaw Tuning"
msgstr "俯仰和偏航调参"

#: ../../source/docs/tailsitter-tuning-guide.rst:16
#: d8c6b406370f4f68b98e23e5c5f98f62
msgid ""
"For pitch and yaw, control is provided by the fixed wing control surfaces, "
"sometimes in conjunction with motor tilt, depending on type of tailsitter. "
"These axes required a tuning approach more similar to normal fixed wing "
"manual tuning, since the FF (Feed-Forward) component of the PID loop is the "
"primary control path, with P and D PID terms providing disturbance "
"corrections. The tuning process is as follows, starting from the default PID"
" values:"
msgstr ""
"对于俯仰和偏航，控制由固定翼控制面提供，有时与电机倾转结合，具体取决于尾坐式的类型。这些轴需要更类似于正常固定翼手动调参的调参方法，因为 PID 回路的"
" FF（前馈）分量是主要控制路径，P 和 D PID 项提供扰动修正。调参过程从默认 PID 值开始如下："

#: ../../source/docs/tailsitter-tuning-guide.rst:18
#: 9879a13c98ca4593b4fe553aa5bd5931
msgid ""
"First, follow Steps 1 - 4 of the normal :ref:`QuadPlane Tuning Process "
"Setup<quadplane-vtol-tuning-process>`."
msgstr "首先，遵循正常 :ref:`四旋翼飞机调参过程设置<quadplane-vtol-tuning-process>` 的第 1-4 步。"

#: ../../source/docs/tailsitter-tuning-guide.rst:19
#: b85bd827a1174e81bded52bc9d9af9ca
msgid ""
"Normally, the vehicle is stable enough with the default PIDs to do a first "
"test hover in QSTABILIZE or QHOVER. Do a short hover flight with logging "
"enabled such that the :ref:`Harmonic Notch Filters<common-imu-notch-"
"filtering>` can be setup. Its important to remove as much motor noise as "
"possible in order to get a good tune using a throttle based harmonic notch "
"filter."
msgstr ""
"通常，使用默认 PID 飞行器足够稳定，可以在 QSTABILIZE 或 QHOVER "
"中进行首次测试悬停。启用日志记录的情况下进行短暂悬停飞行，以便可以设置 :ref:`谐波陷波滤波器<common-imu-notch-"
"filtering>`。尽可能消除电机噪声非常重要，以便使用基于油门的谐波陷波滤波器获得良好的调参结果。"

#: ../../source/docs/tailsitter-tuning-guide.rst:20
#: 84b277261e294592aa1069ba2074f83b
msgid ""
"Once the notch filters are set, do another hover flight but briefly do "
"short, but sharp pitch stick movements in both directions. Do not endanger "
"the vehicle, but try to get several short full stick movements to the front "
"and to the back. Do the same for yaw, but you should be able to hold full "
"yaw stick each direction for a second or so, returning to neutral for a "
"second in-between direction reversals."
msgstr ""
"设置陷波滤波器后，再进行一次悬停飞行，但在两个方向上短暂进行短促但急剧的俯仰摇杆运动。不要危及飞行器，但尝试获得几次前后的短暂全摇杆运动。对偏航做同样操作，但您应该能够每个方向各保持全偏航摇杆约一秒，在方向反转之间回到中位一秒。"

#: ../../source/docs/tailsitter-tuning-guide.rst:21
#: 7c4e7d74210e480492afd6f667ef2598
msgid ""
"Download the :ref:`dataflash log<common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-"
"in-mission-planner>` for analysis. In order to determine the "
":ref:`Q_A_RAT_PIT_FF<Q_A_RAT_PIT_FF>` and "
":ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_FF<Q_A_RAT_YAW_FF>` terms, use a log analyzer like "
"https://plot.ardupilot.org and setup the following plots on the same scale, "
"using the \"Add Expression\" button:"
msgstr ""
"下载 :ref:`数据闪存日志<common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-"
"planner>` 进行分析。为了确定 :ref:`Q_A_RAT_PIT_FF<Q_A_RAT_PIT_FF>` 和 "
":ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_FF<Q_A_RAT_YAW_FF>` 项，使用日志分析器（如 "
"https://plot.ardupilot.org）并使用「添加表达式」按钮以相同比例设置以下图表："

#: ../../source/docs/tailsitter-tuning-guide.rst:28
#: be787ad69d6b41b8b5e5ce8eb122eca0
msgid ""
"Next adjust the X value above until the magnitudes of both plots are about "
"equal. This will now be value for the :ref:`Q_A_RAT_PIT_FF<Q_A_RAT_PIT_FF>` "
"term. Set the :ref:`Q_A_RAT_PIT_I<Q_A_RAT_PIT_I>` term to equal this."
msgstr ""
"接下来调整上面的 X 值，直到两个图的幅度大约相等。这将是 :ref:`Q_A_RAT_PIT_FF<Q_A_RAT_PIT_FF>` 项的值。将 "
":ref:`Q_A_RAT_PIT_I<Q_A_RAT_PIT_I>` 项设置为等于此值。"

#: ../../source/docs/tailsitter-tuning-guide.rst:29
#: fae6f3e32a6a449da051be0dadf88678
msgid "Now do the same for the YAW axis using:"
msgstr "现在对偏航轴做同样操作："

#: ../../source/docs/tailsitter-tuning-guide.rst:36
#: ee6665549af549269f4ac34a4cc83b5a
msgid ""
"Below is an image of this where the X value is adjusted until the two curves"
" are the same amplitude, with a value of x = 0.1. This is then set as the "
":ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_FF<Q_A_RAT_YAW_FF>` and "
":ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_I<Q_A_RAT_YAW_I>` values."
msgstr ""
"下图展示了调整 X 值直到两条曲线幅度相同的情况，值为 x = 0.1。然后将其设置为 "
":ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_FF<Q_A_RAT_YAW_FF>` 和 :ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_I<Q_A_RAT_YAW_I>` "
"的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/tailsitter-tuning-guide.rst:41
#: d44f837960474b529792a950fc98808e
msgid ""
"Now you can hover again, and begin increasing the "
":ref:`Q_A_RAT_PIT_D<Q_A_RAT_PIT_D>` term, either iteratively, or using "
":ref:`common-transmitter-tuning`, until it oscillates and then reduce it to "
"1/2 to 1/3 that value."
msgstr ""
"现在您可以再次悬停，并开始逐步增加 :ref:`Q_A_RAT_PIT_D<Q_A_RAT_PIT_D>` 项，无论是迭代方式还是使用 "
":ref:`common-transmitter-tuning`，直到出现振荡，然后将其降低至该值的 1/2 到 1/3。"

#: ../../source/docs/tailsitter-tuning-guide.rst:42
#: f0f20b0c05f14e43b45020d5ff81d44a
msgid ""
"Then increase the :ref:`Q_A_RAT_PIT_P<Q_A_RAT_PIT_P>` term,, until it "
"oscillates and then reduce it  1/2 to 1/3 that value."
msgstr ""
"然后增加 :ref:`Q_A_RAT_PIT_P<Q_A_RAT_PIT_P>` 项，直到出现振荡，然后将其降低至该值的 1/2 到 1/3。"

#: ../../source/docs/tailsitter-tuning-guide.rst:43
#: b648ba7b5c45482cb3dbbe44222fc896
msgid "Do the same for the YAW axis."
msgstr "对偏航轴做同样操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/tailsitter-tuning-guide.rst:46
#: 0cee20fcb22c4a17b280c6c34109fa20
msgid "Roll Tuning"
msgstr "横滚调参"

#: ../../source/docs/tailsitter-tuning-guide.rst:48
#: f2de866b6ad342798e9dc73b7332b1fe
msgid ""
"This should allow you to get a reasonable tune for Pitch and Yaw. Roll is "
"tuned like STEP 10 for Roll in :ref:`QuadPlane<quadplane-vtol-tuning>`. Roll"
" axis can even be AutoTuned using QAUTOTUNE, if restricted to only the roll "
"axis using :ref:`Q_AUTOTUNE_AXES<Q_AUTOTUNE_AXES>`."
msgstr ""
"这应该能让您获得俯仰和偏航的合理调参结果。横滚按照 :ref:`四旋翼飞机<quadplane-vtol-tuning>` 横滚的第 10 "
"步进行调参。如果通过 :ref:`Q_AUTOTUNE_AXES<Q_AUTOTUNE_AXES>` 限制为仅横滚轴，横滚轴甚至可以使用 "
"QAUTOTUNE 进行自动调参。"

#: ../../source/docs/tailsitter-tuning-guide.rst:51
#: f5ff4272d6f645daa8dd8c6ad2639e6f
msgid "Using the Quick Tune LUA Applet"
msgstr "使用 Quick Tune LUA 小程序"

#: ../../source/docs/tailsitter-tuning-guide.rst:53
#: b0d0f7e6bdb840be9b46b3c29393d86a
msgid ""
"For systems using an autopilot with sufficient memory to run :ref:`LUA "
"scripts <common-lua-scripts>`, such as F7 and H7 based controllers, this "
"process has been automated via a LUA Applet for non-Tailsitter class "
"QuadPlanes, which do not use FF PID terms in their tuning. However, it still"
" can be used for Tailsitters on those types of axes."
msgstr ""
"对于使用内存足够运行 :ref:`LUA scripts <common-lua-scripts>` "
"的飞控（如基于F7和H7的控制器）的系统，该过程已通过一个LUA "
"Applet为非Tailsitter类QuadPlane实现自动化，这些飞机在调参时不使用FF "
"PID项。但对于Tailsitter机型在这些轴上仍然可以使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/tailsitter-tuning-guide.rst:55
#: f932443242a246b2a97b6fd3edc8f293
msgid ""
"See the `Quick VTOL Tune LUA script "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/VTOL-"
"quicktune.md>`__."
msgstr ""
"参见 `Quick VTOL Tune LUA script "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/VTOL-"
"quicktune.md>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/tailsitter-tuning-guide.rst:57
#: d3a0023d097341dc90f4b2830a7a7bd2
msgid ""
"For each FF dominated axis, proceed as above to determine the FF term and "
"set the I term equal to it. Then the applet can be run since it will not "
"change the I term during the process if the FF term is non-zero."
msgstr ""
"对于每个以FF为主导的轴，按上述步骤确定FF项并将I项设置为与其相等。然后可以运行该Applet，因为在FF项非零的情况下，它在执行过程中不会更改I项。"

#: ../../source/docs/tailsitter-tuning-guide.rst:60
#: bf8e07f4a6044fb5960ff871d968d5d7
msgid "VTOL Gain Scaling for Redundant Actuators"
msgstr "冗余执行机构的VTOL增益缩放"

#: ../../source/docs/tailsitter-tuning-guide.rst:62
#: c9383e62ad174b64841d1117fc6e0e71
msgid ""
"Some tailsitters have redundant actuators for a given axis. Vectored thrust "
"tailsitters may have both tilting motors for yaw as well as elevons. Copter "
"tailsitters may have fixed wing control surfaces that produce pitch or yaw "
"in addition to the copter style motors. In some cases, it would be desired "
"to have those fixed wing control surfaces provide more attitude control in "
"VTOL than the motors, reducing the thrust/throttle levels needed for that "
"control."
msgstr ""
"某些tailsitter对于特定轴具有冗余执行机构。矢量推力tailsitter可能同时具有用于偏航的倾转电机和升降副翼。Copter "
"tailsitter可能除了多旋翼风格的电机外，还具有可在VTOL中产生俯仰或偏航的固定翼操纵面。在某些情况下，希望这些固定翼操纵面在VTOL中提供比电机更多的姿态控制，从而降低该控制所需的推力/油门水平。"

#: ../../source/docs/tailsitter-tuning-guide.rst:64
#: b256f957aafb422982d8e3d1938c7566
msgid ""
"The following parameters allow the adjustment of how much control is "
"produced the fixed wing control surfaces for each axis. Larger values apply "
"more gain to the control surfaces, this will give the overall system more "
"gain so the ``Q_A_RAT_`` pitch and yaw PID gains may have to be reduced. To "
"reduce the response of the motors, one would for example, half the PID "
"P/D/I/FF rate gains and use a control surface scale factor of two. This "
"would result in the control surfaces responding as before but with the motor"
" outputs halved."
msgstr ""
"以下参数允许调整每个轴上固定翼操纵面产生多少控制量。较大的值会为操纵面施加更多增益，这将使整个系统增益增大，因此 ``Q_A_RAT_`` "
"俯仰和偏航PID增益可能需要降低。若要降低电机的响应，例如可以将PID "
"P/D/I/FF速率增益减半，并使用2倍的操纵面缩放系数。这将使操纵面响应与之前相同，但电机输出减半。"

#: ../../source/docs/tailsitter-tuning-guide.rst:66
#: 27da009df6e6465c9aca29f1d66105f6
msgid ""
"Default value is 1, which results in no behavior change from the past. These"
" gains are only active in VTOL modes or under Q assist."
msgstr "默认值为1，不会改变以往行为。这些增益仅在VTOL模式或Q Assist辅助下有效。"

#: ../../source/docs/tailsitter-tuning-guide.rst:68
#: d2c18a8acc9c4d1d8d5e50479eb7af50
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_VT_P_P<Q_TAILSIT_VT_P_P>` Scales from Pitch PID output to "
"control surfaces"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_VT_P_P<Q_TAILSIT_VT_P_P>` 将俯仰PID输出缩放到操纵面"

#: ../../source/docs/tailsitter-tuning-guide.rst:69
#: f4696edac4ec44ae9d50953cc2ddf758
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_VT_R_P<Q_TAILSIT_VT_R_P>` Scales from Roll PID output to "
"control surfaces"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_VT_R_P<Q_TAILSIT_VT_R_P>` 将横滚PID输出缩放到操纵面"

#: ../../source/docs/tailsitter-tuning-guide.rst:70
#: b2d1617ce1e140f1821a37f873c335b7
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_VT_Y_P<Q_TAILSIT_VT_Y_P>` Scales from Yaw PID output to "
"control surfaces"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_VT_Y_P<Q_TAILSIT_VT_Y_P>` 将偏航PID输出缩放到操纵面"
